    "plain_text": "Rainier III was the sovereign prince who reshaped Monaco during a five-decade reign. He modernised the constitution, expanded land through reclamation and diversified an economy once heavily dependent on gambling. Monaco also strengthened its international position, while his marriage to Grace Kelly gave the principality exceptional cultural visibility and a lasting philanthropic legacy.",
